  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"assets\\st0186_88dba1e331c3.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 442px;\" />&nbsp;</p><p>Staggered conformation&nbsp;has&nbsp;the lowest&nbsp;van der Waal and torsional strain. Hydrogen atoms are equally placed and there is minimum repulsion between them. Hence, it must be most stable.</p>"
